{
  "info": {
    "name": "BAB CMS API (backend)",
    "_postman_id": "b7a1c3d0-4f21-4a8e-9c31-bab0cms00001",
    "description": "Express API for the BAB CMS.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Import this collection and `bab-api.local.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Select the environment and check `baseUrl` (default `http://localhost:4001`).\n3. Set `adminEmail` / `adminPassword` to match your seeded admin.\n\n## Getting a token\n\nTwo options:\n\n**Real flow (matches production):** run `Auth / 1. Login` — it stores `mfaToken` and emails a 6-digit code. Put that code in the `mfaCode` variable, then run `Auth / 2. Verify MFA code`, which stores `token`. Requires working SMTP.\n\n**Dev shortcut (no email):** run `Auth / Mint dev token (bypass MFA)`. It signs a `mfaVerified` JWT locally with `jwtSecret` and stores it in `token`. Only works when `jwtSecret` matches the server's `JWT_SECRET`.\n\nProtected requests inherit `Bearer {{token}}` from the collection. `requireAuth` re-issues the JWT on every response via the `x-admin-token` header, and a collection-level test script keeps `token` refreshed automatically, mirroring the 20-minute sliding session.\n\n## Production note\n\nPort 4001 is not exposed publicly — nginx only proxies the Next.js frontend. To hit production, run Postman on the server with `baseUrl=http://localhost:4001`, or open an SSH tunnel (`ssh -L 4001:localhost:4001 user@host`).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// requireAuth re-issues the session JWT on every authenticated response.",
          "// Keep {{token}} fresh so the 20-minute sliding window never expires mid-run.",
          "const refreshed = pm.response.headers.get('x-admin-token');",
          "if (refreshed) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', refreshed);",
          "}",
          "",
          "if (pm.response.code === 401) {",
          "  console.warn('401 - run \"Mint dev token\" or the Login + Verify MFA pair to refresh {{token}}.');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:4001", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "admin@bab.com.sa", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "jwtSecret", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "mfaToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "mfaCode", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminUserId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "partnerId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "testimonialId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "jobId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "inquiryId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "applicationId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
